  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed replacement windows, by reason of their design and materials, would be an unsympathetic and incongruous form of development, that would result in harm to the character and appearance of the host building, the streetscene and Battersea Park Conservation Area. The proposal is therefore contrary to policies LP1, LP3 and LP5 of the Local Plan (adopted 2023) and the Battersea Park Conservation Area Appraisal and Management Strategy.",
    "Reason : 2 - In dealing with this application the Council has implemented the requirement in the National Planning Policy Framework to make available detailed advice in the form of our statutory policies in the Local Plan as well as offering a full pre application advice service. "
